{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Faster than they look. More furious than you\u2019d think.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/b42fa41d671119b554b1075bcdb73eec.poster.avif?t=1771094031\" width=950 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/b42fa41d671119b554b1075bcdb73eec.webm?t=1771094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/b42fa41d671119b554b1075bcdb73eec.mp4?t=1771094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>GAMEPLAY INSPIRED BY 16-BIT CLASSICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart of <i>Tuned Turtle</i> lies in the Tuned Shells.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+30 colorful and vibrant levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Tuned Shells with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups inspired by Mario + a fun dash in the spirit of Sonic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret levels packed with adrenaline</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/200240e6f69b5d08daa93b41f13405b2.poster.avif?t=1771094031\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/200240e6f69b5d08daa93b41f13405b2.webm?t=1771094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/200240e6f69b5d08daa93b41f13405b2.mp4?t=1771094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A love letter to those who grew up in the \u201980s and \u201990s (and blew into cartridges!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A PLAYABLE CARTOON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tuned Turtle</i> is a modern reimagining of the classic fable of <i>The Tortoise and the Hare</i>. This time, the race is televised \u2014 surrounded by sponsors, drones, and shady deals happening behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds through fully animated cutscenes filled with sharp, cartoony humor, turning the game into a true playable cartoon experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the turtle\u2019s shell and enter the race as the underdog \u2014 not just to win, but to save your village and take on the greedy sports agent Dirty Duke and his caffeine-fueled pet-athlete, Loko Rabbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/56773e1966f00b78dd2dc92d36d928f8.poster.avif?t=1771094031\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/56773e1966f00b78dd2dc92d36d928f8.webm?t=1771094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/56773e1966f00b78dd2dc92d36d928f8.mp4?t=1771094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Tommy or Tina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about perseverance and the power of community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unforgettable soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully animated cartoon-style cutscenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>80\u2019s EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tuned Turtle</i> was designed to be accessible, but also to challenge players seeking a more intense experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside easier, more casual modes, the game features the 80\u2019s Experience - a special mode inspired by classic games, packed with retro DNA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/cb840086416d24ad5e6f3078d02b8966.poster.avif?t=1771094031\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/cb840086416d24ad5e6f3078d02b8966.webm?t=1771094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/cb840086416d24ad5e6f3078d02b8966.mp4?t=1771094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">80\u2019s Experience Mode: higher difficulty with a taste of nostalgia</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INDIE PROJECT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tuned Turtle</i> is a game made by a small studio in Brazil, made entirely independently and born from the dream of two friends who wanted to make games as fun as the ones that shaped their childhoods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It took many years of careful development, built with love, humor, and respect for the classics - always aiming to create something accessible, yet memorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/30a816e607b60e932106cc6b7079b597.poster.avif?t=1771094031\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/30a816e607b60e932106cc6b7079b597.webm?t=1771094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/30a816e607b60e932106cc6b7079b597.mp4?t=1771094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>\ud83d\udc9a Add the game to your wishlist and help this indie project go even further.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/ec2f73ac54f7440636ea76ea4fd3efad.poster.avif?t=1771094031\" width=616 height=34 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/ec2f73ac54f7440636ea76ea4fd3efad.webm?t=1771094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/extras/ec2f73ac54f7440636ea76ea4fd3efad.mp4?t=1771094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1538990?t=1771094031","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771094031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/fa44410492eda6adffff0278a91d93c948db3b9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771094031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538990/fa44410492eda6adffff0278a91d93c948db3b9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771094031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full"